  "answer": "I found no past ticket that reports this exact problem. Your logs show the copy of the bundled manifests failing with an IOException. The file 'WindowsNT.Notepad.en-US.yml' in %LocalAppData%\\Microsoft\\WinGet\\KeyboardShortcuts is locked by another process. The closest tickets are different problems. PowerToys#48170 is the same 'Failed to copy bundled shortcut manifests' error, but there the Manifests folder is missing (DirectoryNotFoundException). PowerToys#48638 is an access-violation crash in 0.100.0. Neither ticket has a fix for a locked file. Things to try: close any app that might have that yml file open, such as an editor, a sync or backup tool, or antivirus. Then restart PowerToys and reopen Shortcut Guide. You could also disable and re-enable the Shortcut Guide module. If it still crashes, please keep this ticket open as a new report. Include the log lines you pasted. You don't need to upload the full bug report."
 },
